OL,3,GNEWSAMotorist arrested after near-miss
OL,4,Awith police car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof drink-driving after she narrowly
OL,8,Favoided crashing into a police car in
OL,9,FGrimsby.
OL,11,FOfficers witnessed a vehicle "driving
OL,12,Ferratically" at about 03:40 BST on
OL,13,FFriday while they were on a routine
OL,14,Fpatrol in Cleethorpes Road, Humberside
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FThe 60-year-old woman was found to be
OL,18,Falmost three times the legal
OL,19,Fdrink-drive limit after she almost hit
OL,20,Fthe rear of the police car.
OL,22,FShe was taken into police custody.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
